Package: luci-app-port-switch
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Local router administrator
Section: luci
Priority: optional
Depends: luci-base, jshn, jsonfilter, uci
Description: WAN/LAN port switching for GL-MT3000
 A small authenticated LuCI page to swap or restore Ethernet port roles,
 with network backups, a confirmation window and automatic rollback.
